WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.768 --> 00:00:12.284
It was a beautiful day.

2
00:00:12.285 --> 00:00:15.198
Oliver was on his tablet.

3
00:00:15.199 --> 00:00:18.167
"It's nice out," Mom said.

4
00:00:18.168 --> 00:00:20.662
"You should go outside."

5
00:00:20.663 --> 00:00:24.051
Oliver stared at the screen.

6
00:00:24.052 --> 00:00:28.386
"Nah. I'm watching cartoons."

7
00:00:28.387 --> 00:00:32.584
Mom sighed.

8
00:00:32.585 --> 00:00:36.632
Harry walked in and flopped onto the couch.

9
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:39.997
He was on his phone.

10
00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:43.016
"Harry," Mom said.

11
00:00:43.017 --> 00:00:46.597
"You and Oliver should go outside."

12
00:00:46.598 --> 00:00:49.716
Harry stared at his phone. "Huh?"

13
00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:55.328
Mom groaned. "No more video games, Harry."

14
00:00:55.329 --> 00:00:58.530
Harry kept looking at his phone.

15
00:00:58.531 --> 00:00:59.212
"In a minute.

16
00:00:59.213 --> 00:01:01.889
I have to beat this level."

17
00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:04.541
Emmy walked into the room.

18
00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:09.157
She was staring down at her phone.

19
00:01:09.158 --> 00:01:13.351
Bam! Emmy walked right into Mom.

20
00:01:13.352 --> 00:01:17.387
"Don't text while walking," Mom said.

21
00:01:17.388 --> 00:01:21.308
Emmy didn't even look up. "Huh?"

22
00:01:21.309 --> 00:01:27.229
Then she laughed at something on her phone.

23
00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.944
"That's it," Mom said.

24
00:01:29.945 --> 00:01:33.219
"No more screen time!"

25
00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:39.369
Oliver looked up. "There's nothing else to do."

26
00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:45.960
Mom folded her arms. "Go outside. Now."

27
00:01:45.961 --> 00:01:49.107
"Ugh!" Emmy said.

28
00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:52.704
The kids put down their devices.

29
00:01:52.705 --> 00:01:57.107
They went outside.

30
00:01:57.108 --> 00:02:03.488
Then they sat and complained.

31
00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:08.172
Finally Harry got a ball.

32
00:02:08.173 --> 00:02:12.842
Soon they were having fun.

33
00:02:12.843 --> 00:02:16.102
The ball landed near the window.

34
00:02:16.103 --> 00:02:19.606
Oliver got it.

35
00:02:19.607 --> 00:02:23.062
He saw Mom on her phone!

36
00:02:23.063 --> 00:02:27.314
"No fair!" Oliver said.

37
00:02:27.315 --> 00:02:30.540
Mom grinned. "Sorry."

38
00:02:30.541 --> 00:02:32.938
She put down her phone.

39
00:02:32.939 --> 00:02:36.470
She went outside.

40
00:02:36.471 --> 00:02:44.338
"Let's play!" Mom said.
